  "body": "IGNORE THE CV – OVERSEAS VENDOR IS COMMITTED TO SELLING!\r\n\r\nLooking for an opportunity in a premium Milford location without the premium price tag?\r\n\r\nA RARE  MILFORD OPPORTUNITY – ACT NOW\r\n\r\nWe are looking for:\r\n\r\n• Cash buyers wanting to secure a property in sought-after Milford within their budget, with the flexibility to live in it while considering their options.\r\n\r\n• Builders looking for a recladding or rebuild project, with the opportunity to transform the property or explore future possibilities.\r\n\r\n• Renovators looking to add value and create a home to their own vision.\r\n\r\n• Investors seeking a value-add opportunity in a premium Milford location.\r\n\r\n• Bargain hunters looking for an affordable entry into Milford with plenty of potential.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Milford Beach and Milford Village, this five-bedroom home offers space, convenience and plenty of potential. Enjoy easy access to the beach, shopping, cafés, restaurants, transport and sought-after schools, including Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls High Schools, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Campbells Bay School.\r\n\r\nCASH BUYERS • BUILDERS • RENOVATORS • BARGAIN HUNTERS\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing and secure this rare Milford opportunity at an attractive entry point.",
